h1.head Young4Chicks
.container-lg
  .row.justify-content-center.align-items-center
    .col-md-5.text-center.text-md-start
      h3
        .display-2 Hatch Your Future Today
        .displat-5.text-muted Empowering Urban Youths to Thrive in Poultry Farming
      p.lead.my-4.text-muted
        | Whether you&apos;re starting with a single chick or building your own urban brooder
        | empire, Young4Chicks gives you the tools, knowledge, and marketplace to grow. Join a new generation of smart
        | farmers making money, building legacies, and changing the game
      br
    .col-md-5.text-center.d-none.d-md-block
      span.tt(data-bs-placement='bottom' title='Young4Chicks')
        img.img-fluid(src='/images/hero-image.jpg' alt='youngChicks')
  #sidebar.offcanvas.offcanvas-start(tabindex='-1' aria-labelledby='sidebar-label')
