            p.card.text.mx-5.text-muted.d-none.d-lg-block
              | Great for expanding farms. List unlimited products, manage inventory, and receive notifications.
            a.btn.btn-lg.mt-3(href='#') Choose Plan
      .col-7.col-lg-3.col-xl-3
        .card.border-0
          .card-body.text-center.py-4
            h4.card-title Pro Farmer
            p.lead.card-subtitle Listings, analytics &amp; expert tools
            p.display-5 $499.99
            p.card.text.mx-5.text-muted.d-none.d-lg-block
              | Designed for serious farmers. Get full access to insights, expert advice, customer reviews &amp; more.
            a.btn.btn-lg.mt-3(href='#') Upgrade Now
section#topics
  .container-md
    .text-center
      h2 Young4Chicks at a Glance
      p.lead.text-muted
        | Here&apos;s what you can expect from Young4Chicks and how it can help you buy and sell
        | poultry with ease.
    .row.my-5.g-5.justify-content-around.align-items-center
      .col-6.col-lg-4
        img.img-fluid(src='/images/hero-for-something.jpg' alt='epig')
      .col-6.col-lg-4
        #chapters.accordion
          .accordion-item
            h2#heading-1.accordion-header
              button.accordion-button(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-1' aria-expanded='true' aria-controls='chapter-1')
                | 1. Getting Started with Young4chicks
            #chapter-1.accordion-collapse.collapse.show(aria-labelledby='heading-1' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
              .accordion-body
                p
                  | Welcome to Young4chicks! This platform connects poultry buyers and sellers, making it easy to find
                  | or sell chickens, ducks, turkeys, and more. To get started, simply create an account, browse our
                  | marketplace, and connect with local farmers or sellers. You can search for specific breeds, prices,
                  | and locations to find the perfect poultry for your needs.
                p
                  | To create an account, simply click on the &quot;Sign Up&quot; button and follow the prompts. You&apos;ll need to
                  | provide some basic information like your name, email address, and password. Once you&apos;ve created your
                  | account, you can start exploring the marketplace and connecting with other users. Our platform is
                  | designed to be user-friendly, so you can easily navigate and find what you&apos;re looking for.
          .accordion-item
            h2#heading-2.accordion-header
              button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-2' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-2')
                | 2. Buying Poultry Made Easy
            #chapter-2.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-2' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
              .accordion-body
                p
                  | Buying poultry is simple with Young4chicks! Browse our marketplace to find a wide variety of
                  | poultry breeds and prices. You can filter your search by location, price, and breed to find the
                  | perfect birds for your farm or backyard. Once you find a seller you&apos;re interested in, you can send
                  | them a message or place an order directly through the app.
                p
                  | When you find a seller you&apos;re interested in, you can view their profile and read reviews from other
                  | buyers. This can help you get a sense of their reputation and the quality of their poultry. You can
                  | also contact the seller directly through the app to ask questions or negotiate prices. Our platform
                  | makes it easy to communicate with sellers and find the perfect poultry for your needs.
          .accordion-item
            h2#heading-3.accordion-header
              button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-3' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-3')
                | 3. Selling Poultry with Confidence
            #chapter-3.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-3' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
              .accordion-body
                p
                  | Selling poultry is easy and secure with Young4chicks! Create a listing for your birds, including
                  | photos, prices, and descriptions. Buyers can browse your listings and contact you directly through
                  | the app. We provide tools and resources to help you manage your sales, track payments, and ensure a
                  | smooth transaction.
                p
                  | To create a listing, simply click on the &quot;Create Listing&quot; button and follow the prompts. You&apos;ll
                  | need to provide some information about your poultry, such as the breed, age, and price. You can also
                  | add photos and descriptions to make your listing more attractive to buyers. Our platform provides
                  | tools and resources to help you manage your listings and respond to buyer inquiries.
          .accordion-item
            h2#heading-4.accordion-header
              button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-4' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-4')
                | 4. Payment and Security
            #chapter-4.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-4' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
              .accordion-body
                p
                  | At Young4chicks, we prioritize secure payments and transactions. Our platform uses trusted payment
                  | methods and encryption to protect your financial information. When you make a payment or receive
                  | funds, you can trust that our system is secure and reliable. We also provide guidance on payment
                  | best practices to ensure a smooth transaction.
                p
                  | We also provide guidance on how to avoid scams and ensure a safe transaction. Our platform is
                  | designed to protect both buyers and sellers, and we take security seriously. If you have any
                  | concerns or issues with payments, our support team is here to help. We&apos;re committed to providing a
                  | secure and trustworthy platform for all our users.
            .accordion-item
              h2#heading-5.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.collapsed(type='button' data-bs-toggle='collapse' data-bs-target='#chapter-5' aria-expanded='false' aria-controls='chapter-5')
                  | 5. Support and Resources
              #chapter-5.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='heading-5' data-bs-parent='#chapters')
                .accordion-body
                  p
                    | Need help or have questions? Our support team is here to assist you! We provide resources and
                    | guides on poultry care, sales tips, and more. You can contact us through the app or website, and
                    | we&apos;ll respond promptly to help you with any issues or concerns.
                  p
                    | In addition to our support team, we also have a knowledge base and FAQ section that can help you
                    | find answers to common questions. We&apos;re constantly updating our resources and guides to ensure
                    | that you have the information you need to succeed. Whether you&apos;re a seasoned poultry farmer or
                    | just starting out, we&apos;re here to help you every step of the way
